// chriz-iwd-encounters 330: the experience for Joril's badge (on top of the area
// script), only when he did not hand it over himself: the peaceful handover in his
// dialogue pays the same and sets Got_Joril_Badge. Fires in the same pass as the
// badge block, which no longer pays.

IF
  Global("JORIL_BADGE","GLOBAL",0)
  Global("Got_Joril_Badge","GLOBAL",0)
  PartyHasItem("JORIL")
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    AddXP2DA("%cie_jor_xp%")
    Continue()
END
